    V_TIERS["TIER MEANING: LIGHT = already at/near standard, leave alone (L5). POLISH = good bones — add why-language, salt & pepper at each stage, deepen 1–2 steps, keep everything else. REWRITE = full WOW re-author (method + chefNotes + feeling line), same JSON schema, ingredients/costing untouched unless broken."]
    V_HERO["⚠️ HERO ESCALATION (Tina to confirm): decent-but-thin FAMOUS mains promoted to REWRITE because L20 will demand 4–5 versions of them anyway — Doro Wat, Chicken Tagine, Ghanaian Jollof, Zanzibar Biryani, Umngqusho, Durban Chicken/Mutton/Fish Curry, Lamb Breyani. If Tina disagrees, they drop to POLISH (~15 dishes lighter)."]
